# HakiOS defconfig for the OnePlus 8T (oneplus8t, SM8250 "kona", devices/oneplus8t): the common kernel,
# the SoC family's facts, and this phone's own -- put together the way an Android kernel's defconfig is.
#
# Nothing of this phone's hardware has been brought up yet, so this is the "first boot, with nothing of
# the phone's" configuration of docs/porting/index.md, step 2: the SoC's own drivers stay (they read the
# chip, not the board), and every phone driver of the common tree is left out of the kernel in
# configs/oneplus8t.config.
#
# Needs no firmware yet: the drivers that would read fw-*/ are the ones left out.
#include common_defconfig
#include sm8250.config
#include oneplus8t.config
